{"run_id": "run_773d57e954c4", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张强吗？我是站长。我看到你已报名飞毛腿。请记住，午餐和晚餐高峰期需要上线。单日合同每天至少完成5单，多日合同每天至少完成3单。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是张强。有什么事吗？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天你的飞毛腿合同已经生效了，请问你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "可以，我今天有空，可以配送。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那太好了。提醒你一下，飞毛腿合同需要按要求完成配送，如果未完成，合同可能会受到影响。另外，报名是按排名进行的，减少拒单、取消、超时，恶劣天气订单量更高时更有助于保住资格。配送时注意安全。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我明白了。那如果多日合同连续几天完不成会怎样？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "目前很多骑手正在申请飞毛腿，如果无法连续配送，名额可能会被他人占用。所以尽量每天完成。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我会注意的。那完成多日合同有奖励吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "连续完成7天多日合同，且每天完成3单，可获得额外奖励，每单比单日合同多0.5元。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，谢谢站长。我会好好干的。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，祝你工作顺利，注意安全。再见。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "accepted", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_773d57e954c4", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s02_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张强吗？我是站长。我看到你已报名飞毛腿。请记住，午餐和晚餐高峰期需要上线。单日合同每天至少完成5单，多日合同每天至少完成3单。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。什么事？我正忙着呢，快说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，长话短说。今天你的飞毛腿合同已经生效了，你能开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "今天？我今天没时间，明天再说吧。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。不过合同今天生效，如果今天不完成最低单量，可能会影响后续派单。你明天能上线吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "明天应该可以，但今天真不行。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那我先记录一下。另外提醒你，飞毛腿是按排名分配的，如果连续完不成，名额可能被占。你明天方便什么时间？我安排个回访确认。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "明天中午吧，一点左右。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记下了。明天一点左右再联系你。注意安全，再见。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 7, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "preferred_time": "2025-03-22 13:00"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_773d57e954c4", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s03_reject", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张强吗？我是站长。我看到你已报名飞毛腿。请记住，午餐和晚餐高峰期需要上线。单日合同每天至少完成5单，多日合同每天至少完成3单。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天你的飞毛腿合同已经生效了，请问你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "今天不太行，我有点事，不想跑。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解，不过这个合同需要按要求完成配送，如果今天不跑的话，可能会影响后续的合同和派单。你看能不能尽量安排一下？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "真的不行，今天确实有事。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我理解。那方便告诉我具体是什么原因吗？我记录一下。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "就是个人私事，不太方便说。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，没问题。那我先记录你今天无法配送的情况。另外提醒一下，如果后续想退出飞毛腿，需要在晚上12点之前在App的报名入口取消，次日生效。你还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那先这样，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 8, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "个人私事，不方便说明"}, "result": {"status": "recorded", "rejection_id": "virtual_rejection_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "rejected", "identit