{"run_id": "run_773d57e954c4", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_004", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s04_faq_exit", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张强吗？我是站长。我看到你已报名飞毛腿。请记住，午餐和晚餐高峰期需要上线。单日合同每天至少完成5单，多日合同每天至少完成3单。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。有什么事吗？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天你的飞毛腿合同已经生效了，请问你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "可以是可以，不过我想问一下，如果我不想干了，怎么退出？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我帮你查一下退出规则。请稍等。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "根据规定，如需退出飞毛腿，需要在前一天晚上12点之前在App的飞毛腿报名入口取消，次日生效。你还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "那如果我连续几天不配送会怎样？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "目前很多骑手正在申请飞毛腿，如果无法连续配送，名额可能会被他人占用。所以建议你尽量按要求完成配送。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，那我今天先跑着吧。还有什么要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，感谢你愿意配送。提醒你注意安全，另外飞毛腿报名按排名进行，减少拒单、取消、超时，恶劣天气订单量更高时更有助于保住资格。祝你顺利！"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢站长，再见。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "agent", "content": "再见，注意安全。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "如何退出飞毛腿"}, "result": {"status": "faq_answered", "answer": "如需退出飞毛腿，需要在前一天晚上12点之前在App的飞毛腿报名入口取消，次日生效。"}, "latency_ms": 120, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task